        "text": "overall great stay! Property was clean organized and had everything we needed for a week Long Beach stay. the rooms and bathrooms were spacious and comfortable as well.the location was great- right in the middle of rosemary and Alys beach- 5-10 min walks to each. Easy access to restaurants and bike rentals. beach and pool tram also great and came fairly quicklyWouldRecommend to family and friends !",
